# Gannet Rock - a new small island of the library (ROADMAP 3d NI3), no quest
# A little rocky islet with a single knoll where sea-birds nest, and a plank jetty running out from its east shore into the
# water - a fisherman's: a crate and a net on its head. Nothing hostile. Things to gather on land and in the shallows,
# a treasure buried somewhere on it for Raft's metal detector.
#
# Built by the recipe player (CIRecipe gannet_rock) through the editor's own operations. Points: the knoll's top (6 m,
# r 3 round -3 3), its nests; the jetty's root on the east shore at 14 0 (1.35 m), the jetty x 14..32 at z -1.5..1.5,
# deck 1.5 m, its head x 29..32 (z -2.25..2.25); the fisherman's crate on the head at 30.5 1.2.
include lib_huts
include lib_sea
include lib_features
include lib_ni34
new
# (nature: a rocky islet - fewer trees and more rocks than Raft's tropical average)
gen Trees=0.15 Bushes=0.25 Rocks=0.5 Harvest=0.2 BeachThings=0.3
gen Seed=7401 Radius=24 Height=7 Roughness=0.45 Peaks=1 Shape=0 Style=0 BeachWidth=0.5 Cliffs=0.4 PeakShape=0.5
gen SeaFloor=0 Shelf=0.5 Seabed=2
gen Water=0.5 SeaRocks=0.45 SeaFinds=0.3 Sunken=0.4 Hostiles=0 Friendly=0 SeaLife=0
generate

# ===== Terrain: the knoll's top, the jetty's root ======================================================================
brush flatten at -3 3 r=4.5 s=20 frames=140 h=6
brush flatten at 13 0 r=3 s=20 frames=60 h=1.35
brush rock at -3 3 r=6 s=20 frames=20
clear at -3 3 r=4
clear at 13 0 r=3.5

# ===== The nests on the knoll ===========================================================================================
place Bird_Nest - at -3.5 2 ground sit
place Bird_Nest - at -2.2 4 ground sit yaw=70
place Bird_Nest - at -4.2 4.1 ground sit yaw=150

# ===== The jetty out from the east shore, the fisherman's crate and net on its head ======================================
push at 14 0
call jetty n=10 h=1.5 d=8
pop
place Loot_Crate fishcrate at 30.5 1.2 h=1.5 sit yaw=15
place FishingNets_02 - at 30.4 -1.1 h=1.5 sit yaw=80
note fishcrate Fisherman's crate | A crate lashed to the jetty's head: bait, a coil of rope, spare planks for the deck.
loot fishcrate Rope*3;Plank*4;FishingBait_Simple*3;Raw_Herring*2
prop fishcrate loot.refill=0

# ===== Things to gather: pineapples; a buried treasure; Raft's finds in the shallows; a turtle and dolphins ================
scatter "Pickup_Landmark_PineappleLandmark" 2 at 0 0 r=12 seed=7411 free=3
call treasure x=0 z=0 r=10 n=1 seed=7401
call shallows r=40 deep=5 n=1 seed=740
place Creature_Turtle turtles at 0 -34 h=-1.5
place Creature_Dolphin dolphins at 45 -20 h=-3
prop dolphins creature.count=2

info title=Gannet Rock
info author=Custom Islands
info description=A small rocky islet where the sea-birds nest, a fisherman's plank jetty running out from its east shore. No quest - an island to explore.

save Gannet Rock
